logs":[{"nodeId":745030101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30411,"speakerName":"アルボン","textMapHash":2895358042,"text":"お二人さん、また会ったな。ちょっとしか経ってないのに、もう君たちに会いたくなってたところやで。","nextNodeIds":[745030102]},{"nodeId":745030102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1944903506,"text":"おまえってやつは、ホントにゴマすりがうまいな！","nextNodeIds":[745030103]},{"nodeId":745030103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30411,"speakerName":"アルボン","textMapHash":4046565170,"text":"嫌われたか、悲しいな。やっぱり仕事に専念しよか。","nextNodeIds":[745030104]},{"nodeId":745030104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30411,"speakerName":"アルボン","textMapHash":3857590306,"text":"まず、今回のデータ収集は大きく二つに分かれてて、俺とアルベールがそれぞれ一つずつ担当してるんや。","nextNodeIds":[745030105]},{"nodeId":745030105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30411,"speakerName":"アルボン","textMapHash":35288242,"text":"俺が担当してるデータ収集は、決闘代理人の柔軟性をシミュレートするためのものや。君には水中でのダッシュシミュレーションにトライしてほしいんやで。","nextNodeIds":[745030106]},{"nodeId":745030106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2833440530,"text":"ってことは、決闘代理人って水中で訓練してるのか？","nextNodeIds":[745030107]},{"nodeId":745030107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30411,"speakerName":"アルボン","textMapHash":3056125938,"text":"さあ？俺は決闘代理人を見たことないからな。たぶん店主も見たことないと思うけど、そのほうがカッコいいやろ？って。","nextNodeIds":[745030108]},{"nodeId":745030108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30411,"speakerName":"アルボン","textMapHash":2783922610,"text":"元々はおもちゃのアームの中に十種類の水鉄砲を組み込んで、シュッシュッシュ～って水を発射させたかったらしいけど、コストが高すぎて諦めたそうやで。","nextNodeIds":[745030109,745030110]},{"nodeId":745030109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":951768154,"text":"確かにカッコいい。","nextNodeIds":[745030111]},{"nodeId":745030111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30411,"speakerName":"アルボン","textMapHash":2993891290,"text":"フォンテーヌは水の国やからな。外国に広く売り込むなら、フォンテーヌの特徴を活かしたほうがいいやろ？","nextNodeIds":[745030112]},{"nodeId":745030112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30411,"speakerName":"アルボン","textMapHash":2513029570,"text":"とにかく、具体的な注意点についてはハンドブックを用意したから、後で読んでみてな。","nextNodeIds":[745030113]},{"nodeId":745030113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30411,"speakerName":"アルボン","textMapHash":3954421994,"text":"どうや？今にも始めたくてうずうずしてきたやろ？","nextNodeIds":[745030114]},{"nodeId":745030114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1234929378,"text":"少し準備する。","nextNodeIds":[745030115]},{"nodeId":745030115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30411,"speakerName":"アルボン","textMapHash":2556892506,"text":"問題ないで。データ収集の機器はすでに設置済やから、心配いらん。君たちは挑戦をクリアすることにだけ集中すればいい。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":745030110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3699139634,"text":"カッコいいと思うのは子供だけでしょ。","nextNodeIds":[745030111]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7450301,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30411"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7450301],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30411,"speakerName":"アルボン","count":10},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":3},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":2}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[174503],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":4161804310,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"